<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC REVISES DOWN H1 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC REVISES DOWN H1 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zywiec SA final results for first</p>
<p>half ending June 30</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						 H1 1996     H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			8.21  vs   13.64</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  5.73  vs   19.82</p>
<p>    net profit				2.85  vs   12.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Piwowarskie w Zywcu</p>
<p>Zywiec SA. Earlier the company reported a net profit of 3.12</p>
<p>million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			     162.94  vs  128.58</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 67.01  vs   47.26</p>
<p>    extraordinary				-  vs	 -</p>
<p>    income tax				2.88  vs    7.33</p>
<p>    other taxes				  -  vs	 -</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    0.80  vs    6.89</p>
<p>    financial costs			 3.28  vs    0.72</p>
<p>    depreciation			   18.89  vs   17.31</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
